{"lines": [{"text": "Why you should never cheat your partners in crime.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.258, "spec": {"shot": "hero"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Why", 0.086, 0.194], ["you", 0.194, 0.269], ["should", 0.269, 0.474], ["never", 0.485, 0.84], ["cheat", 0.841, 1.045], ["your", 1.045, 1.142], ["partners", 1.153, 1.466], ["in", 1.466, 1.519], ["crime", 1.519, 1.886]]}, {"text": "In 1950, eleven men planned to rob the Brink's vault in Boston.", "start": 2.358, "end": 7.11, "spec": {"shot": "roof"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In 1950", 0.075, 1.088], ["eleven", 1.282, 1.681], ["men", 1.681, 1.886], ["planned", 1.897, 2.349], ["to", 2.511, 2.619], ["rob", 2.629, 2.963], ["the", 2.974, 3.05], ["Brink's", 3.06, 3.351], ["vault", 3.351, 3.718], ["in", 3.847, 3.922], ["Boston", 3.922, 4.44]]}, {"text": "For months, they secretly copied the key to every door.", "start": 7.21, "end": 10.618, "spec": {"shot": "keys"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.119, 0.226], ["months", 0.226, 0.733], ["they", 0.97, 1.078], ["secretly", 1.088, 1.487], ["copied", 1.487, 1.897], ["the", 1.897, 1.94], ["key", 1.94, 2.241], ["to", 2.252, 2.425], ["every", 2.543, 2.748], ["door", 2.748, 3.071]]}, {"text": "Then, in Halloween masks, they walked right in.", "start": 10.718, "end": 13.358, "spec": {"shot": "enter"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.086, 0.323], ["in", 0.485, 0.593], ["Halloween", 0.593, 1.034], ["masks", 1.034, 1.53], ["they", 1.552, 1.638], ["walked", 1.638, 1.918], ["right", 1.918, 2.101], ["in", 2.112, 2.317]]}, {"text": "In about twenty minutes, they took over a million dollars in cash.", "start": 13.458, "end": 16.818, "spec": {"shot": "vault", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.086, 0.14], ["about", 0.14, 0.334], ["twenty", 0.334, 0.593], ["minutes", 0.593, 1.002], ["they", 1.25, 1.347], ["took", 1.358, 1.541], ["over", 1.552, 1.756], ["a", 1.756, 1.778], ["million", 1.778, 2.101], ["dollars", 2.101, 2.425], ["in", 2.435, 2.5], ["cash", 2.5, 3.039]]}, {"text": "